<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Dear {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for expressing interest in the Master of Arts in Social Justice and Human Rights program at Arizona State University. The MA in Social Justice and Human Rights is a theoretically and methodologically rigorous program addressing the urgent social issues of our time. Training students for research and advocacy roles in both the governmental and nongovernmental sectors, the program explores solutions for real-world problems related to human security, labor, migration, children, family, education and the environment.&nbsp; For more information about the program feel free to review the <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/sites/default/files/general/sjhr_graduate_handbook_2015-2016v1.pdf">MASJHR Program Handbook.</a><br><br>Be sure to review our&nbsp;<a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B44BICxe1BtdX003ZHhEWWhnazg/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank">application checklist</a><b> </b>for more information about the application process in an easy to follow format, and peruse our <a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B91ycyfLEFl7ZTVOaHNjTkNrdUE">sample schedule</a><b> </b>to explore the flexible curriculum available for both full-time and part-time students. Also, please take a moment to check out our new <a href="http://links.asu.edu/xqkbm">e-magazine</a><a> </a>and see all the exciting work being done by our faculty and students.<br><br>It's important to find the right fit in graduate school. A great way to learn more about this degree is to register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can view the dates <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fnewcollege.asu.edu%2Fadmissions%2Fgraduate-student%23info-sessions&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3eyBeebKJl5UB8G4D0hhOqUBSSA">here</a>, then email me to RSVP for any date you plan to attend.<br><br>Kindest regards,<br>Graduate Studies<br><br>New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences<br><font color="#990000">Arizona State University, West campus<br><font color="#000000"><a href="mailto:nc.gradstudies@asu.edu">nc.gradstudies@asu.edu</a><br><br></font></font><br><br><br><font color="#C0C0C0">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>